VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'computer. Another small thing I\'ve noticed is that Astra more often will intervene and send you a message in the middle of working, ask you questions about the specific direction of the prompt. And if you\'re like me, it will'

[22:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'calmly ask you to stop butting in when it\'s trying to use your computer via the plugin. In this sense, it feels more agentic. So, my friends, what does this all really boil down to? I keep coming back to the thought of how powerful'

